-- Paid Parental Leave Act 2010 (Commonwealth), compilation C2026C00425, section 6 (the Dictionary):
-- the entries for the terms that Chapter 2 Parts 2-1 to 2-3 Division 4 use.
-- Every other entry of the Dictionary is outside this encoding.
-- Part 1: a table with one row for each entry the in-scope text uses (what kind of entry it is, and what it points at or borrows from).
-- Part 2: the entries that define a term in the Dictionary itself, as functions of the facts they read.
-- A term that "has the same meaning as" another Act's is asked as a fact where a rule needs it; a signpost ("see section N") is
-- encoded where the section it points to is encoded.

§ `Part 1 -- the entries the in-scope text uses`

DECLARE `Kind of definition` IS ONE OF
    SeeProvision
    DefinedInTheDictionary
    SameMeaningAsInAnotherAct
    NamesAnAct
    OrdinaryMeaningWith
    ShortFor

DECLARE `Dictionary entry` HAS
    term IS A STRING
    kind IS A `Kind of definition`
    `points to or borrows from` IS A STRING
    line IS A NUMBER


