`an instrument is part of this Act` MEANS
    CONSIDER instrument
    WHEN `Any other instrument` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:295 | PPL rules (short for Paid Parental Leave Rules) means the rules made by the Minister under section 298.
