    JUST `the rules are made by the Minister under section 298`

-- src:315 | Secretary means the Secretary of the Department.
@ref s 6, Secretary means the Secretary of the Department (src:315-315)
GIVEN `the person is the Secretary of the Department` IS A BOOLEAN
