-- src:272 | parental leave pay means payments of parental leave pay under this Act.
@ref s 6, parental leave pay means payments of parental leave pay under this Act (src:272-272)
GIVEN `the payment is a payment of parental leave pay under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
